findings.comment:
750.800b - The following were observed to be soiled;
A) hood over cooking equipment - baffles and light covers (grease/dust);
B) fry baskets (buildup);   and
C) top inside microwave (dried food splash).

Clean and sanitize food contact surfaces between uses/as needed, up to every 4hrs after continuous use, to prevent cross contamination and eliminate buildup of debris

750.800b - The following food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) inside ice machine (mold - around opening in ceiling where ice comes out behind the whit baffle);
B) kitchen hood baffles (dust/grease);
C) pizza oven trays (carbon).

Clean and sanitize food contact surfaces between uses/as needed to prevent cross contamination and eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) bottom inside pizza freezer (food debris);
B) ice bin drain (mold) - NOTE: ice bin located by soda guns at bar;
C) walkin cooler - fan covers and electrical cord for fan (dust);
D) table holding grills in kitchen (dust/food debris);  
E) surfaces on underside of kitchen 3 part sink (dust);   and
F) food dry storage shelves (dust/onion skin beneath can storage).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) dry storage shelves beneath canned goods (onion skin/dust);
B) counter under popcorn machine (food debris);
C) drip trays of grill (carbon/debris);    and
D) inside fryer (bottom around mechanicals - dust/little bit of food debris)

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris, and maintain clean.

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) counter under microwave (dust/crumbs);
B) surfaces between pizza ovens and microwave (dust/debris);
C) storage crates under kitchen 3 part sink (dust/general buildup);   and
D) dry storage shelves behind onions (onion skin).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris, and maintain clean.
